cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FIRAI, please cite the release you used."
type: dataset
title: "FIRAI: Forensic Investigation Reference for AI"
abstract: >-
  An openly licensed knowledge base for post-incident forensic investigation
  of AI systems. FIRAI catalogues investigative techniques across five
  forensic phases and seven AI evidence classes ordered by volatility, with
  maturity grades, access requirements, NIST AI RMF lifecycle stages,
  forensic readiness measures and open research gaps.
authors:
  - name: "Cyber Science Lab, University of Guelph"
    city: Guelph
    country: CA
version: 0.1.0
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
url: "https://firai.cybersciencelab.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CyberScienceLab/FIRAI-Data"
keywords:
  - AI forensics
  - digital forensics
  - incident investigation
  - AI incidents
  - forensic readiness
  - taxonomy
